  <item>
    <title>GameFi崛起的东南亚，会成为Web3独角兽的沃土吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63bd64a3da83c49d996a60c1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63bd64a3da83c49d996a60c1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jan 2023 13:14:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>东南亚是一个人口不断增长、收入不断增加的多元化地区，也是近十年来受到投资最多的新地区。这里不仅是投资者的天堂，也是创业者的圣地，每年都有很多 Web3 builder 前往东南亚寻找高增长的机会。今天Web3GO Labs邀请了五位对东南亚Web3有深入了解的嘉宾一起探讨一下东南亚的加密布局。</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜Elsa</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chain Capital Founding Partner Simon Li</span></p><span></span><p><span>AC Capital Partner Vincent</span></p><span></span><p><span>MetaKey Founder Suki</span></p><span></span><p><span>Beosin Managing Director Tommy Deng</span></p><span></span><p><span>数字游民 上野</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>【你将听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a>】 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a>】 为什么大家选择东南亚build Web3？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a>】 东南亚哪些赛道的项目比较多？分布在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a>】 新加坡Web3政策以及现状解读</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a>】 香港Web3现状分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">42:53</a>】 马来西亚Web3情况分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a>】 机构端为什么选择东南亚的企业投资？东南亚的资本情况怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4019">1:06:59</a>】 给想去东南亚团队的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>【在这里找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Twitter账号：<a data-url="https://twitter.com/Web3Go_" href="https://twitter.com/Web3Go_">twitter.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Discord社区：<a data-url="https://discord.gg/6FMNqmjw4y" href="https://discord.gg/6FMNqmjw4y">discord.gg</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：Web3GO Labs</span></p>]]></description>
